Job Description 
 Build the future with us
 Are you passionate about cybersecurity, product management and organizational transformation, and looking to contribute to the purpose of a company that strives to ensure its clients feel confident and secure about their future?
 The Information Security Protection and Analysis (ISPA) team is looking for a Product Manager to contribute to the evolution of its operational cybersecurity capabilities.
 As a Security Product Manager, you will play a key role in shaping and executing the vision for the security products under your responsibility. You will help guide investments, prioritize initiatives and maximize delivered value to reduce risk, improve operational efficiency and support organizational objectives.
 This role is an excellent opportunity to leverage your strategic skills, influential leadership and ability to engage multidisciplinary teams. Here, people and their development are at the heart of what we do, fostering an environment that encourages collaboration, innovation and continuous improvement.
 What you’ll accomplish with us
 As a Product Manager, you will be at the heart of the evolution of our operational security capabilities. Your main responsibilities will include:
 Understand, promote and clearly communicate the business value of the cybersecurity capabilities and services under your responsibility;
 Develop, communicate and evolve product vision, strategy and roadmaps in alignment with ISPA objectives, organizational priorities and business partner needs;
 Translate risk reduction objectives, operational needs and strategic directions into value-generating initiatives;
 Define expected outcomes, business benefits and performance indicators to measure the value delivered;
 Continuously manage the product backlog, including its content, prioritization, clarity, consistency and visibility, while considering business needs, risks, dependencies, regulatory requirements, security considerations, technical debt and operationalization activities;
