 Collaborate with security experts to evolve the capabilities under your responsibility;
 Identify opportunities for automation, process simplification and continuous improvement;
 Proactively and collaboratively identify and resolve risks, issues and dependencies related to the product roadmaps under your responsibility;
 Assess the impact of changes in scope or priorities on teams, stakeholders and business objectives, and recommend appropriate solutions;
 Collaborate with architects, analysts, engineering teams and operational teams to develop solutions that meet organizational needs;
 Contribute to defining strategies for the delivery, deployment and adoption of security capabilities;
 Act as a leader and subject matter resource within your area of expertise for multidisciplinary teams;
 Contribute to the preparation of strategic business cases, recommendations and presentations for various decision-making bodies;
 Balance agile product management principles with governance, accountability, budget management and risk management requirements.
