 Experience in the insurance or financial services industry, or in a highly regulated environment;
 Experience in vulnerability management, cloud security, security operations or threat exposure management;
 Certification in product management, agile methodologies or portfolio management;
 A cybersecurity certification such as CISSP, CISM or equivalent;
 Knowledge of the CTEM framework.
